{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/capsule_small__3_.png?t=1745437931\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruby Journey</strong> is an <i>immersive sim</i> taking place in a village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive with just <strong>one\u00a0gold</strong>, and you want their <strong>ruby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade</strong>, do <strong>quests</strong>, manage your resources wisely to get <strong>richer</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to PNJs and grow friendships, all while discovering their lore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif27674.gif?t=1745437931\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Befriend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've officially come to help the village to recover from its recent hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish the locals' quests to gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif102017.gif?t=1745437931\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you help a local, the more trades he propose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif83887.gif?t=1745437931\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enrich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tools are the engine of your economic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif54130.gif?t=1745437931\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hamlet is also a story. Learn more about what happened recently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif70004.gif?t=1745437931\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00ab A cozy game in a cozy village. Make money and get the ruby. \u00bb</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Have fun !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/capsule_small.png?t=1745437931\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441200?t=1745437931","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745437931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/84aa78296d1bdb5af3ef88368c76a3cc5f7a6fb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745437931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/84aa78296d1bdb5af3ef88368c76a3cc5f7a6fb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745437931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3499630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/capsule_small__3_.png?t=1745437931\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruby Journey</strong> is an <i>immersive sim</i> taking place in a village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive with just <strong>one\u00a0gold</strong>, and